  "goodToKnow": "Das Gütesiegel is a seal of quality or label: ein staatliches Gütesiegel, das Bio-Siegel for organic food. Germany's Blauer Engel, created in 1978, is one of the world's oldest eco-labels. Test results from Stiftung Warentest are also used like seals on packaging. Critics warn of a jungle of Siegel. Die Güte means quality and kindness: Ach du meine Güte! (goodness me). The plural is the same."
